{"id":"1a7474d8b25c4444","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-hyp-hierarchy.md","title":"按有效序数记号索引的跳跃层级","display":"df-hyp-hierarchy — 按有效序数记号索引的跳跃层级","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-hyp-hierarchy","aliases":["20-df-hyp-hierarchy"],"display":"df-hyp-hierarchy — 按有效序数记号索引的跳跃层级","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"definition-source-pending","source_reference":"书外有效记号层级的规范化；完整来源待补","depends_on":["[[20-df-kleene-O]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-hyp-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-hyp-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hyp-hierarchy — 按有效序数记号索引的跳跃层级"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-source-pending"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"书外有效记号层级的规范化；完整来源待补"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e811ef811223aaaa\" href=\"?note=e811ef811223aaaa\" title=\"20-df-kleene-O\">20-df-kleene-O</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(a\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>；按上游良基记号系统递归。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e811ef811223aaaa\" href=\"?note=e811ef811223aaaa\" title=\"20-df-kleene-O\">20-df-kleene-O</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 definition-source-pending；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,n,x\\in\\omega\">\\(e,n,x\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(H:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> 是沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_\\mathcal O\">\\(&lt;_\\mathcal O\\)</span> 的良基递归；后继式仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(a\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span> 使用，极限式仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span> 使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyp\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nH_1:=\\varnothing,\\qquad H_{2^a}:=H_a&#39;,\\\\\nH_{3\\cdot5^e}:=\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:x\\in H_{\\varphi_e(n)}\\}\n\\quad(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyp\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nH_1:=\\varnothing,\\qquad H_{2^a}:=H_a&#39;,\\\\\nH_{3\\cdot5^e}:=\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:x\\in H_{\\varphi_e(n)}\\}\n\\quad(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>极限列由记号中明确给出的全可计算基本序列提供，所有列指标是自然数。原稿用任意序数 α 直接作自然数配对、在极限取未经编码的全部前驱 join，均不合法。不同同秩记号所得集合的度等价是另一个需证明的定理，此处不先作商。依赖不再从层级回指 HYP，消除旧循环。</p>\n<p>来源：书外有效记号层级的规范化；完整来源待补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-kleene-O","status":"resolved","id":"e811ef811223aaaa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-kleene-O]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-kleene-O","status":"resolved","id":"e811ef811223aaaa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kleene-O]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kleene-O]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kleene-O]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"e,n,x\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"H:\\mathcal O\\to\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"<_\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyp\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nH_1:=\\varnothing,\\qquad H_{2^a}:=H_a',\\\\\nH_{3\\cdot5^e}:=\\{\\langle n,x\\rangle:x\\in H_{\\varphi_e(n)}\\}\n\\quad(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1863,"backlinks":[{"id":"d387a906642794f7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]；see [[20-df-tred]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"4011ec29b6dff303","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"重点入口：编码与模型 [[20-df-strings]]、[[20-df-tmcomp]]、[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；对象与接口 [[20-df-tred]]、[[20-df-characteristic]]、[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]；逻辑 [[20-df-formula]]、[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]、[[20-df-pa]]；树与构造 [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]、[[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]]；博弈 [[20-df-gale-stewart]]、[[20-df-bm-strategy]]；良基递归 [[20-df-kleene-O]]、[[20-df-hyp-hierarchy]]。"}],"outgoing":["e811ef811223aaaa","e890b3c29e4a70a3","08b4fd5163a7f955"]}